OL,3,GNEWSAMajor repairs start at
OL,4,Afire-damaged railway line
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of West Midlands railway is
OL,7,Fthe subject of a major repair operation
OL,8,Ffollowing "significant damage" suffered
OL,9,Fduring the Stourbridge fire.
OL,11,FNineteen properties across five streets
OL,12,Fwere fully destroyed, while 18 homes
OL,13,Fwere damaged by the blaze which started
OL,14,Fon Thursday.
OL,16,FWest Midlands Fire Service said about
OL,17,F40 acres of land had been affected,
OL,18,Fwhich included the nearby railway line.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
